  "result": "Found Jonnard et al. (2015) interlaboratory comparison of WDS-EDS on metallic glass. Found references to NIST-led material round robins. Found Seidel et al. (2021) multi-technique comparison including aluminum alloys. No aluminum-alloy-specific round robin was identified.",
